          "entities_top_k": 20,
          "maps_to": "graph-pipeline's search(query_type=HYBRID_COMPLETION, only_context=True, verbose=True, datasets=[ns]). 20 chunks, 20 entities (graph-pipeline's reported BEAM 100K configuration hybrid_completion_20_20_qa_v1), 10 facts; the harness packs the returned items to the 8,000-token budget. Why: the largest documented hybrid setting; the harness truncates to the shared budget"
