      "deviations_from_vendor_code": [
        "Session documents are added as JSON text through DataItem (with a pinned data_id and the source id as label) instead of a JSON file on disk; JsonListChunker reads the same JSON list either way.",
        "Turns are paired in arrival order (1-2, 3-4, ...) and labelled by speaker; graph-pipeline's BEAM code pairs user and assistant turns. LoCoMo has two named speakers and no assistant.",
        "The item header keeps Session/Turn/Time anchor but the session number is the ingestion order inside the namespace, not a dataset session id.",
        "No BEAM turn compression, no session distillation and no global context index: they are BEAM-specific additions in local_ingest.py, not part of add + cognify, and the reported 100K retrieval did not query the global index.",
        "graph-pipeline's search with verbose=True is used instead of its recall: for only_context completion types recall returns one rendered prompt string, while search(verbose=True) returns the same retrieval as separate ranked chunks, entities and facts with chunk document ids.",
        "No per-question-type answer prompts: the harness's fixed reader answers.",
        "AMB's graph-pipeline provider (vectorize-io/agent-memory-benchmark@f618ed7) ingests all documents then cognifies once and retrieves CHUNKS top 50 with fastembed; this shim follows graph-pipeline's own BEAM code instead because it exercises the graph."
      ]
    }
